-- ONE OF lists a field's options; it cannot be the type of a rule's input
-- (specs/proposals/INLINE-ONE-OF-FIELD-SPEC.md §5.1, third row). The same
-- message answers GIVETH, ASSUME and the inside of those types.
GIVEN tenure IS ONE OF Owner, Tenant, Lodger
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`owned` tenure MEANS tenure EQUALS Owner
